  "seq": [
   "Did you gather the seeds from the Groens up the hill?",
   "Oh yeah! Thanks! I love them so much.",
   "Wow, you're really a natural at cooking! The recipe came out just like my grandma's.",
   "Now, if you want to go and check out the festival, just head up the hill and go through...",
   "Bless you, Nar!",
   "Ooooh, your little friend sneezed fire on the cream, and now it's ruined.",
   "Are you sure it's ruined? Sometimes cuisine happens in the most unexpected ways.",
   "Look, the extreme temperature sneeze from Nar caramelised the cream into rock-hard candy.",
   "I'm adding this to my recipe book!",
   "Maybe you can use it for the contest.",
   "And about that, you can start going, I'll catch up with you in a while. See you in town!"
